{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,5",{"I'm sorry, I truly am - stay away from the others, I'll stay with you for a while","Bitten - alright - don't panic, let's find a quiet place for you to sit","I can't fix that, I wish I could - is there someone you want me to find?"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Oh no- oh God no... show me, let me see it, please","Bitten?! when? how long ago? no, don't tell me, tell me, WHEN?","Hey, hey, look at me, breathe, I'm not leaving, I'm not going anywhere, okay?","Oh sweetheart... oh, I'm so sorry, I'm so, so sorry","Sit down, sit, just sit with me a second, you don't have to be brave","Not you... you were one of the good ones, it's NOT FAIR!","I- I'm not scared of you, I want you to know that, I'm not scared of you","Don't run, don't hide, stay here, we'll figure it out, somehow, we'll figure it out","No- no, no, no, NO","Oh God.. oh God.. oh no.. show me.. show me.. please tell me it's a scratch","I'm- I'm sorry, I'm so- fuck, I'm so sorry","Don't- don't go yet, don't go, stay, stay a minute, please","Hey, hey, look at me, LOOK at me, you're still you, you're still YOU","Oh sweetheart.. oh honey.. come here.. come here..","Damn it, damn it, DAMN it, you were one of the good ones!!","How long ago? ...no, don't, I don't wanna know","No... not you, please, I only just met you","I'm so sorry, I got nothing to say","Is it deep? Show me, let me look, maybe it's just a scratch, maybe it's nothing","Come here, come sit, we'll figure something out, I won't leave you, I won't","God, God, God, why does this keep happening to good people?","I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I wish I could do something, anything"},false,false,{[9]={{t="not you",afterMs=1800},{t="please not you",afterMs=2200}}}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=sad",{"I'm sorry... I wish I had something to give you, a word, a pill, a prayer... anything","Let me stay a little while, just stay, you shouldn't be alone for this"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=neutral",{"Bitten? Back up, back UP, just- just give me some room, okay? please","How long ago?! Don't come any closer, I'm sorry, I'm so sorry","Oh my God, you're bit- stay right there, don't move!","I don't know what to do, I don't know what to do, I'm so sorry, I can't help you","Is it deep? did it break the skin? tell me it didn't break the skin","That's- that's terrible, that's awful, I wish I could help, I just can't be near you, I'm sorry","I'm not sending you away, I'm just, I'm scared, and I have people to look after","Get BACK- back up- back UP, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I can't","No no- you're bit?! You're BIT?! Stay there, STAY!","Oh shit, oh shit, oh SHIT, I'm sorry, but you can't come near me","Don't touch me! I'm sorry! I'm so sorry! I can't!","Jesus, Jesus, how bad? how deep? no, no, don't tell me","Bitten?! Stay back, stay back, please, I'm sorry, I can't, I have people to protect","Oh no, oh no, you can't be near us, I'm so sorry, you can't","How long ago? Tell me exactly how long ago, minutes? Hours?"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"GET AWAY FROM ME! stay back, stay BACK, I'll hit you, I'll- I WILL","No no no no no, don't come near me, not another step","You're bitten? You're BITTEN?! get out, get out of here, GO","Keep your distance, keep it, I'm not helping you, I can't, you'll turn","You should've told me first, you should've said it before you got close!","Stay AWAY! I'll- I will- STAY BACK","Not one step closer!! not ONE!","Get away from me, get AWAY, not another step!","You KNEW, and you came HERE?!","Stop right there! Don't you take one more step toward me - I mean it","You're bit and you walked right up to me? Get away from here - are you going?"},false,{[11]="LEAVE_NOW"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly",{"Show me, let me see it, I'm a nurse, I won't hurt you, I'll be gentle, and I'll be honest","Hold out your arm, slowly, is it a bite? a scratch? I need to know the difference","Clean it, wrap it, and don't hide it, tell me every symptom, every ache, I'm here","I can't cure it, I'm so sorry, but I can make it easier, and I can stay"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly",{"My child, come, sit, you don't have to be alone in this","The Lord's with you right now, and so am I, I'm not going anywhere","Tell me what you need, forgiveness, company, silence, I'll give it to you"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly",{"Let me see it- when'd it happen, where, how deep?","Stay calm, we've got a minute, we've got a few minutes, let's use them well"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Understood, I'll need you to stay put, hands where I can see them, we'll sort this out","Listen to me, you're not dead yet, you've got time, let's use it right","Oh, friend, I'm sorry, the pastor can sit with you, if you like"}},
