{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"You're what? Bitten? Oh, shit... SHIT! Get away from me, back off!","How long ago? Tell me exactly how long, and don't lie","Bitten... damn it, kid, I'm sorry, I really am, but you can't stay near me","Show me, slowly, show me the bite, and don't make me regret asking","Oh no, no, no, don't tell me that, I just started liking you"}},
