{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Oh, God... man, I'm so sorry, I don't know what to say, I'm so sorry","That's rough, {g:buddy|lady}... that's the worst thing anyone's ever told me, and I've heard a lot"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Bitten? Aw hell, naw, naw, don't come near me, I'm serious","Man, how long? Nah, forget it, I don't wanna know, just stay back","Damn... I'm sorry, I got nothing, I got nothing to say"}},
