{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Fuck.. fuck.. FUCK.. I'm sorry, God I'm sorry","Damn it, damn it, DAMN IT, why you?","Jesus.. I.. I don't know what to say.. I'm here, okay? I'm here","Damn, I'm sorry, I really am, you deserve better than this","Show me, let me see it, no judging, I just need to know how bad","Shit... how long ago? how are you feeling? tell me everything","That's... that's the worst news, I'm so sorry, friend","You told me... out of everybody, you told me, that's something, thank you"}},
