{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh God, oh no - I'm sorry, I'm so sorry, but you can't stay here - please go - please, okay?","Don't come closer - I'm sorry, I'll leave a bottle of water right here and back away - it's all I can do","Maybe it's just a scratch? My cousin got scratched and he was fine for, he was fine for a while"},false,{[1]="LEAVE_NOW"}},
