{"PLAYER_HURT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Hurt?! where, where does it hurt, can you walk, can you breathe, tell me","Oh God, you're bleeding, you're BLEEDING, sit down, sit, press here, hard","Easy, easy, don't move, let me look at it, I'm no doctor, but I'll try!","Hey, stay with me, stay awake, say something, anything!","It's okay, you're gonna be okay, we'll fix this, I promise","That looks bad, that looks really bad, I'm so sorry, hold on, hold on tight","Come here, lean on me, I've got you, I've got you, don't let go","Oh shit, oh shit, you're bleeding, you're BLEEDING, sit, sit down","Hey, hey, hey, don't pass out, look at me, stay with me","Jesus, that's bad, that's bad, hold this, press, PRESS","Where?! where does it hurt?! tell me, tell me!","Fuck, I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry, I wasn't fast enough","Deep breath, I got you, I've GOT you","Jesus, look at you, you're white as a sheet, sit, sit down right now","How bad is it? Don't lie to me, how bad?","I've got a clean rag and a half bottle of water, that's all, but it's yours","Okay, breathe, I'm here, let me see it","Don't be brave, be smart, let me look at it","Hold still, this is going to sting, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, it's going to sting","You need to get that cleaned, now, infection is the second killer, believe me","Lie down, lift it up, higher than your heart, that's what my mom always said","Ah, hell, that's deep, we need to close it up, somebody find a needle and thread","I'm no medic, but even I know that needs attention, come here","Easy, easy, you're shaking, drink something, anything","Should I shout for help? Tell me what to do, I'll do anything"}},
{"PLAYER_HURT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=sad",{"I hate seeing you like this... please, just let me help"}},
{"PLAYER_HURT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=neutral",{"Hurt? you need a doctor, find a doctor, find a nurse, I can't help, I'm sorry","Oh, that's rough, that's really rough, I wish I could do more","I've got a bandage, one bandage, that's all I can spare, I'm sorry","Sit down, rest, don't move around, you'll make it worse","I'm not a medic... but I'll point you to someone who is, give me a minute","Oh God, that looks awful, sit, rest, don't move","Hurt? Where? Is it bad? Is it really bad?","I can't help much... I'm sorry, I'm so sorry, but sit down.."}},
{"PLAYER_HURT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Hurt? so what? we're all hurt, what do you want me to do about it?","Get yourself fixed, and don't bleed on me!","Keep your distance, and keep your blood to yourself","Hurt? Back off, I can't, I don't know you","Stay there, I'll toss you a bandage, don't come closer","How hurt? Don't lie, is it a bite?","Hurt? How hurt? Is it a bite? Show me, show me, no tricks","Stay there, don't come closer until I know it isn't a bite","Is that a bite? Don't lie to me - is that a bite or not?","Hurt how? Stay right there and show me where - don't come any closer"},false,{[9]="GENERIC"}},
{"PLAYER_HURT","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly",{"Show me, let me see, where does it hurt, how bad on a scale of one to ten, be honest","Hold still, hold STILL, I need to clean this, it'll sting, bite down on something","I've got you, breathe with me, in... out... good"}},
{"PLAYER_HURT","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly",{"Rest, my child, rest, you're not alone, there's water, there's time","Let's get you out of the sun first, everything else comes after the sun"}},
{"PLAYER_HURT","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly",{"Alright, I've got medical training, let's check airway, breathing, circulation, talk to me"}},
