{"PLAYER_SAD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Oh... oh, I'm so sorry, I'm so, so sorry, come here, come here","Hey, hey, it's alright to cry, go ahead, cry, nobody's counting","I lost mine too, I know how this feels, it never gets easier, it just gets different","I wish I knew what to say, I don't, I just wish I knew","Sit, sit with me, let's not talk, let's just sit, that's enough","That's the worst, isn't it? the worst thing in the world... I'm here, I'm here","Hey, come here, you don't have to say anything, I'll just sit with you","I'm so sorry, I wish I had words, I only have a shoulder","Do you want to talk about them? Tell me their name, tell me one thing about them","I lost someone too, I know the hole you're in, I won't tell you it gets better","Cry, cry if you want, I won't tell anyone, I'll even cry with you","That's the worst thing in the world, I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry"}},
