{"PLAYER_SAD","st=friendly",{"It's all right, take your time - start wherever","What was their-- what's their name? Sorry, I didn't mean to rush you","Oh, hell, I'm sorry, I really am","You were mad at them - so? Doesn't mean you didn't love them","You can cry, won't bother me","We don't have to talk - just... don't feel like you've got to keep talking for me","What were they like? Before, I mean, if you feel like telling me","Hey, you don't have to tell me the rest, it's okay to stop","Were they funny? Tell me something they used to do - if you want","Are you all-- no - sorry - stupid question - go on","Jesus, you shouldn't have had to deal with that","Wanna keep talking about it? Or change the subject? Up to you","No, no, I can hear you - don't apologize","Yeah... I'm still here - go on"}},
